WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:13.473
"Where is Mr. Grill?" Jeb asked.

2
00:00:13.474 --> 00:00:17.340
"He said to meet here."

3
00:00:17.341 --> 00:00:22.973
"Maybe he forgot," Poppy said.

4
00:00:22.974 --> 00:00:28.394
"I don't think so," Dipper said.

5
00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:33.873
Everyone looked around.

6
00:00:33.874 --> 00:00:43.760
But they didn't see the teacher.

7
00:00:43.761 --> 00:00:46.725
"Hey!" Gasser said.

8
00:00:46.726 --> 00:00:51.486
"What's this?"

9
00:00:51.487 --> 00:00:54.057
Eddy saw a sheet of paper.

10
00:00:54.058 --> 00:00:58.499
There was an oval on it.

11
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:07.019
"Hmm," Eddy said.

12
00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:09.650
"It looks like a racetrack."

13
00:01:09.651 --> 00:01:12.463
Poppy gasped.

14
00:01:12.464 --> 00:01:16.496
"I bet Mr. Grill left it!" she said.

15
00:01:16.497 --> 00:01:19.865
Everyone looked confused.

16
00:01:19.866 --> 00:01:23.367
"Why did he leave it?" Zippy asked.

17
00:01:23.368 --> 00:01:27.336
"So we can find him," Poppy said.

18
00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:31.664
"I think it's a clue."

19
00:01:31.665 --> 00:01:34.730
"Oh, fun!" Dipper said.

20
00:01:34.731 --> 00:01:37.891
"Let's go to the racetrack!"

21
00:01:37.892 --> 00:01:42.516
Everyone hurried to the racetrack.

22
00:01:42.517 --> 00:01:46.509
Eddy saw a sign.

23
00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:57.389
It said, "Race!"

